+// Of n pads +[GCController supportsHIDDevice:] said yes to, which does GameController not list (out[i] = 1: only raw HID reads pad i)? A pad is covered by a listed controller of its
+// name; GameController may name a controller differently from its HID product, so a listed controller no name matched covers one pad too. Up to PAD_HID_MAX pads and controllers.
+static void pad_hid_unlisted(const char *const *pad, int n, const char *const *listed, int m, uint8_t *out) {
+    uint32_t used = 0; int spare = m;
+    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
